[statement]
The packages a change frees are removed in the order the package changed
states its dependencies: `o2` before `o1`.

[repository]
P:app
V:2

[installed]
P:o1
V:1

P:o2
V:1

P:app
V:1
D:o2 o1

[world]
app

[request]
app>=2

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade app 1 2
remove o2 1
remove o1 1
